/-- [The propensity overlap object](goal) is defined from [the supplied inputs](hyp:P). -/
def PropensityOverlap (P : TransportLaw) : Prop :=
  ∀ x ∈ covariateSpace, (1 / 4 : ℝ) ≤ P.e x ∧ P.e x ≤ 3 / 4

